eeing and Thames River Boats depart from Westminster Pier."},{name:"East End Jewish Walking Tour",description:"Discover the rich history of 19th-century Jewish immigrants in Spitalfields and Brick Lane."}],hotels:[{name:"Savoy Hotel",description:"Iconic luxury hotel on the Strand combining Art Deco and Edwardian elegance.",price:"$$$$$"},{name:"Pillar Hotel Hendon",description:"A boutique hotel set on lush grounds in Hendon catering specifically to kosher travelers.",price:"$$$"}],restaurants:[{name:"Novellino",description:"An elegant, high-end kosher Italian dairy restaurant in Golders Green.",kosher:!0}],transportation:"London Underground (The Tube) is remarkably quick, clean, and extensive. Tap-and-go with credit cards.",nearby:["Oxford","Windsor Castle","Cambridge"],kosherRestaurants:[{name:"Novellino",address:"103 Golders Green Rd, London",kashrus:"London Beth Din (Milchig)"}],chabad:[{name:"Chabad of Hendon",address:"112-114 Brent Street, London NW4 2DT",rabbi:"Rabbi Mendy Overlander",phone:"+44 20 8202 1600",website:"https://www.chabadlive.com/",shabbatMeals:!0}],synagogues:[{name:"Hendon Adath Yisroel Congregation",address:"11 Brent Street, London NW4 2EU",nusach:"Ashkenaz",photo:""}],eruvInfo:"London has several major eruvin, including the North West London Eruv covering Golders Green, Hendon, Hampstead Garden Suburb, and Finchley."},{id:"rome",name:"Rome",country:"Italy",region:"Europe",flightTimes:{"New York":"8h 30m",Miami:"10h 15m",Jerusalem:"3h 45m",Paris:"2h 00m",London:"2h 30m"},weather:"☀️ 74°F",experiences:["Hiking","National Parks"],mustDo:"Jewish Ghetto Tour & Ba'Ghetto Dinner",description:"The Eternal City, where ancient colossal ruins stand side-by-side with a unique Jewish community dating back to the Roman Empire.",bestTimeToVisit:"April to June and September to November",nearestAirport:"Leonardo da Vinci-Fiumicino Airport (FCO)",airportDistance:"16 miles",attractions:[{name:"The Colosseum",description:"The epic, iconic stone amphitheater of 